    {
      "id": "p0091-b003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "In the English version of Undertale, the message “YOU WON!” appears after a successful battle. At Toby’s direction, this was changed to “YOU WIN!” in the Japanese game. This minor rewording is actually an intentional reference to a change made during MOTHER 2’s English localization into EarthBound:",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.0886302,
          0.215,
          0.708023,
          0.2885714
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.0886302,
          0.215,
          0.708023,
          0.2885714
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "text": "英文版 Undertale 在战斗获胜后会显示“YOU WON!”（你赢了！）。按 Toby 的要求，日版将它改成了“YOU WIN!”。这点小小的措辞变化，其实是在有意致敬 MOTHER 2 本地化为英文版 EarthBound 时的一处改动：",
        "status": "draft",
        "spans": [
          {
            "start": 4,
            "end": 13,
            "italic": true,
            "lang": "en"
          },
          {
            "start": 88,
