    {
      "id": "p0091-b007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "As we can see, the original Japanese version of EarthBound displayed “YOU WIN!” after each battle, but this was changed to “YOU WON!” for its English release. Toby was eager to keep this tradition alive with Undertale’s localization, just in the opposite direction.",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.0886302,
          0.4814286,
          0.708023,
          0.5557143
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.0886302,
          0.4814286,
          0.708023,
          0.5557143
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "text": "可以看到，EarthBound 的日文原版在每场战斗后显示“YOU WIN!”，英文发行版却改成了“YOU WON!”。Toby 很想让 Undertale 的本地化延续这项传统，只不过方向恰好反了过来。",
        "status": "draft",
        "spans": [
          {
            "start": 5,
            "end": 15,
            "italic": true,
            "lang": "en"
          },
          {
            "start": 69,
